    "basis": "Measured original bare earth on the main approach at the head of the current Edmund-Körner-Platz steps."
  },
  "notes": "The original 1914 measured Steeler Tor, Steeler Straße, Alfredistraße and rear elevations establish the ashlar façade around the 34 m dome, double rows of molded cornices, four domed towers and the graduated portal. Essen’s survey specifies prepatinated copper and limestone in the ongoing repairs."
